      "id": "hook",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 7,
      "say": "So one of the big reasons why many people are afraid to start a YouTube channel is because of the fear of speaking in front of the camera.",
      "why": "Hook: the fear of speaking to camera, full face, no cards.",
