    {
      "id": "story",
      "start": 30.3,
      "end": 43.2,
      "say": "Let's get into it. So I have been posting videos on YouTube for about a year now and what I can say is that even till now I still get nervous in front of the camera. For long this has kept me from creating videos on YouTube,",
